<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Bank of Thailand July notes auction schedule.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Bank of Thailand July notes auction schedule.</headline>
<text>
<p>BANGKOK, July 3 (Rueter) - The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday it has scheduled the weekly auctions in July for a total of 11 billion baht ($393 million) in short-term central bank notes. The following is the auction schedule:</p>
<p>Bank of Thailand note auctions:</p>
<p>    Date		     Maturity (Days)	Amount</p>
<p>							  (million baht)</p>
<p>    4/7/97			28		    2,000</p>
<p>    4/7/97			91		    1,000</p>
<p>    4/7/97		     182		    1,000</p>
<p>   11/7/97			28		    2,000</p>
<p>   18/7/97			27		    2,000</p>
<p>   18/7/97			90		    1,000</p>
<p>   25/7/97			28		    2,000</p>
<p>($1 = 28 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
